    "name": "Carrot (Baby) Bunch",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">A \"baby carrot bunch\" refers to&nbsp;\"true\" baby carrots, which are young carrots harvested before full maturity, sold with their green tops attached, and characterized by a petite, tender, sweet, and often colorful appearance.&nbsp;Unlike manufactured \"baby-cut\" carrots, these are naturally small and full of flavor, making them ideal for cooking or raw consumption.</span></p>",
